    },
    {
      "Trigger": "AllFreed",
      "Objective": "jailbreak",
      "Line": {
        "Text": "So my cages stand empty. Now ask my founder\u0027s lad why he kept his bloody mouth shut while the old man poured my iron. I said I\u0027d break the old man\u0027s neck if the lad talked.",
